      "text": "Sawa ka na ba sa traffic? Baka kailangan mo lang ng creative detour! 💡🛣️ \n\nThe DAY6 Philippines VCR Team is inviting all PH My Day to submit their own fan entries to be shown on the VCR for DAY6 < THE DECADE > in Manila! We welcome creative submissions in any visual form.\n\n🗓️ Open until November 2, 2025 or until *cap is reached.\n\n📝 Please visit the form for more details: https://t.co/v91vXoecFo\n\n*30 artworks\n\n#KM0_AllRoadsLeadToDAY6\n#DAY6_10th_Anniversary_Tour\n#The_DECADE #The_DECADE_MANILA",
